#. [campaign]: id=Pearls_and_Pirates
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/_main.cfg:42
msgid ""
"A sleepy fishing village on Wesnoth’s west coast finds itself suddenly beset"
" by corsairs. With requests for royal aid falling on deaf ears, the "
"villagers must join forces with the local merfolk and bring the fight to the"
" pirates."
msgstr ""
"Wesnoth’un batı kıyısındaki sakin bir balıkçı köyü, birdenbire korsanların "
"saldırısına uğrar. Kraliyet yardımı talepleri duymazdan gelinince köylüler, "
"yerel susallarla güç birliği yaparak savaşı korsanlara taşımak zorunda "
"kalır."

#. [campaign]: id=Pearls_and_Pirates
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/_main.cfg:44
msgid "(Novice level, 5 scenarios.)"
msgstr "(Acemi seviyesi, 5 senaryo.)"

#. [campaign]: id=Pearls_and_Pirates
#. this campaign is not a direct continuation of the story and characters, but
#. is next chronologically and is the recommended next campaign
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/_main.cfg:48
msgid ""
"The saga continues in\n"
"<i>The Deceiver’s Gambit</i>"
msgstr "Destan devam ediyor"

